  "sourceFindings": [
    "Publication rechecks live owner/epoch against database time, then exact revision, attempt, lifecycle fence and job kind. Journal transition, terminal Oban job and reservation release share one SQL transaction.",
    "Downloads re-admit the exact journal locator after file verification. Storage accepts digest-addressed, bounded, non-writable regular files within an operator-owned local root and compares the body length and SHA-256 before returning it.",
    "Customer cancellation and normal environment wiring for the native adapter are L05 integration gaps. This run opted in through application config and invoked the internal cancellation transaction; resumed restricted Oban performed stop and release.",
    "Worker state and output retention depend on the local operator. This run tested explicit disposal after proof, not production retention or garbage collection."
  ],
